Z||000000||88 Database Nut||12-15-1999||01:14 PM||||As many of you already know, I'm putting together a database of '88 Fieros, in the hopes to someday have a registry of them.  Right now we have 883 cars documented, and I thought I ought to ask the nice group here for more help.  Several of you answered my last call for help, and I thank you for taking the time to send me your car's info.  All I need is the VIN, and a brief description of your car, like original colors, tranny type, etc.  I'll be happy to add as much info as you want to send me to the database, and if you wish anonymity, that is perfectly fine too.  This is a CAR database, not an owners db.  Thanks to all for their past help, and any they can give me in the future.  A friend has put a summary of the car's which are in the database up on his website.  To see them, goto:   <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/motorcity/track/3487/index.html" TARGET=_blank>www.geocities.com/motorcity/track/3487/index.html</A> <P>Thanks, Happy Holidays!||||reg||12
