Z||000003||88 Database Nut||01-01-2000||09:37 AM||||Thanks guys, and Happy New Year!  The info you guys provided are the first entries of the millenium.  Hope you all made out OK last night.  I'm visiting my parents in Sebastian FL (near Vero Besch) and have seen quite a few cars rolling around down here.  Anyone else reading this down here?<P>Thanks again guys, we're up to 892 cars with your help.  I do appreciate it.  <P>HNY!  John Willhoff ||||reg||7
