Z||000008||88 Database Nut||01-19-2000||07:54 AM||||Thanks Turbo86SE, That's another one gone forever (most likely) that I'd have missed without your help.  Hey Guys, if you see an '88 in a Junkyard, how about getting the VIN for me, to document it's demise in the '88 Fiero Database.  So far, we've got info on 922 cars (well, 923 now thanks to Mr. Turbo86SE).  You can see a breakdown of the cars in the database at a friends website, <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/motorcity/track/3487." TARGET=_blank>www.geocities.com/motorcity/track/3487.</A> <BR>Thanks for all your help!<BR>John Willhoff aka 88 Nut||||reg||14
