Z||000027||88 Database Nut||02-10-2000||12:41 PM||||Hey guys, Thanks DIS, Shop, Carolles,and Alex!  That helps me out with 4 more cars and some good info on that Junkyard car.  I'll look forward to adding those two parts cars in Fieroshop.  With everyone's help, we are up to 954 cars documented.<P>Many Thanks for all your help, Hope everyone has a great weekend.  I'll be pulling the motor out of one of my cars to put in a new clutch, waterpump, timing gear, rear main seal, rear cam seal, port the manifolds, new throwout fork and bushings and input shaft bearing, new hoses.  whew.  It sounds like alot,and it is, but it's all SOOOO much easier when the engine is sitting there on the cradle on the shop floor (especially when you snap off a couple of exhaust manifold bolts/studs).   ||||reg||14
